title: The Battle for Coruscant
subtitle: The Sith Lord's gambit is decided.
tags: event
view-if: finale and gambit and finale_day >= 3 and gambit_response_seen and not gambit_resolved
max-visits: 1
priority: 10
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_war.svg
on-arrival: {!
Q.gambit_resolved = 1;
if (Q.clones >= 3 && !Q.chips_removed && !Q.army_oversight) { Q.order66 = 1; Q.jedi_strength = 1.5; }
var f = SW.forces(Q);
var sith = f.sith;
if (Q.gambit_kind === 'exposed') sith -= f.sithParts.security_bloc * 0.5 + 1;
if (Q.gambit_kind === 'coup') sith -= 1;
if (sith < 0.5) sith = 0.5;
Q.gb_ratio = Math.round(100 * (f.rep + Q.gambit_bonus) / sith) / 100;
if (Q.gb_ratio > 1.1) { Q.sidious_defeated = 1; Q.sidious_method = 'trial'; Q.sidious_gone = 1; }
else if (Q.gb_ratio >= 0.6) { Q.civil_war_result = 'long'; Q.game_ending = 1; }
else { Q.empire_declared = 1; Q.game_ending = 1; }
!}

= The Battle for Coruscant

[? if order66 : In the first hours, the clones turn on the Jedi. The Order is almost destroyed. ?]

[? if sidious_defeated : The loyalists hold. [? if gambit_kind = "coup" : Mas Amedda's guards surrender when they see the Defence Pact squadrons overhead. ?] Palpatine is found in a sealed chamber beneath the Senate, his face ruined by his own lightning, and taken alive. **Darth Sidious** will stand trial before the Senate he tried to destroy. ?][? if civil_war_result = "long" : Coruscant is split block by block, and then the galaxy splits with it. The Sith Lord holds the capital and the Core, and the Free Republic the rest. ?][? if empire_declared : The loyalists are overwhelmed. By dawn, Palpatine stands before a cowed Senate and proclaims the Galactic Empire. ?]
